  "title": "Cinnamon Pancakes in a Jar",
  "description": "A lovely mix that can be placed in a jar to give as a gift. A great change from cookies in a jar. Just copy the recipe onto a card and attach it to your jar to give as a gift.",
  "authors": [
    "Carla"
